</div>

<div class="box">
    <div class="inner-box">
        <h1>Join Our Mission Today</h1>
        <p>Every action counts. Whether you donate your time or your resources,<br> you are helping us build a more compassionate world.</p>
        <div class="fix">
        <button class="btn3"onclick="window.location.href='/volunteer/form'">Become a Volunteer</button>
        <button class="btn3" onclick="window.location.href='/donate/form'">Donate Now</button>
    </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="footer">
  <div class="contact">
    <h2>Helping Hands NGO</h2>
    <p>Dedicated to creating sustainable impact <br>
       through community empowerment and <br>
       focused social initiatives.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact">
    <p>Quick Links</p>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Campaigns</a>
    <a href="#">Events</a>
    <a href="#">Contacts</a>
  </div>

  <div class="contact">
    <p>Support</p>
    <a href="#">Donate Now</a>
